Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 13 | Text: 如果说你的女儿找个送外卖的结婚
Segment #2   [00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:02,500] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 4  | Text: 你家不家
Segment #3   [00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:03,300] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 3  | Text: 你拿什么
Segment #4   [00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,260] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 12 | Text: 给我女儿保证她以后想要的生活
Segment #5   [00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:06,760] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 7  | Text: 祖国女儿长大了
Segment #6   [00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:07,900] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 6  | Text: 让她怎么选对象
Segment #7   [00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,840] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 12 | Text: 这个东西不是你作为父母能够左右
Segment #8   [00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:12,640] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 11 | Text: 你只能去给她处理建立一个
Segment #9   [00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:15,080] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 10 | Text: 好的价值观 事业观 三观正
Segment #10  [00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:17,740] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 10 | Text: 然后她能选择什么样的老公
Segment #11  [00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:20,500] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 11 | Text: 取决于她小的时候和谁做邻居
Segment #12  [00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,320] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 9  | Text: 上学以后和谁做同桌
Segment #13  [00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:23,900] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 10 | Text: 长大以后参加什么样的工作
Segment #14  [00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,460] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 8  | Text: 以及她踏入社会之后
Segment #15  [00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,300] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 5  | Text: 她能挣多少钱
Segment #16  [00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:28,900] | Elapsed:  15.18s | Words: 9  | Text: 如果说你的女儿一个月能挣
Segment #17  [00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:33,080] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 12 | Text: 那她就只能找同范围的男朋友
Segment #18  [00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:35,960] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 12 | Text: 如果说你的女儿一个月能挣20个W
Segment #19  [00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:36,500] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 2  | Text: 那行了
Segment #20  [00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:37,260] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 4  | Text: 你不用担心
Segment #21  [00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:38,580] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 7  | Text: 不光是咱自己的孩子
Segment #22  [00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:39,980] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 6  | Text: 比如说彭慧倩的
Segment #23  [00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:40,800] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 4  | Text: 你是个女孩子
Segment #24  [00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:42,780] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 9  | Text: 在你没有一个独立人格之前
Segment #25  [00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:43,640] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 4  | Text: 也不要结婚
Segment #26  [00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:44,440] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 6  | Text: 也不建议结婚
Segment #27  [00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:45,960] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 8  | Text: 如果说你指望的结婚
Segment #28  [00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:47,760] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 11 | Text: 通过一个婚姻来改变你的命运
Segment #29  [00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:48,940] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 6  | Text: 所谓的攀高针
Segment #30  [00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:49,920] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 3  | Text: 没用的
Segment #31  [00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:50,300] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 2  | Text: 看不到
Segment #32  [00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:51,920] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 3  | Text: 内心话
Segment #33  [00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,460] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 9  | Text: 自古以来不都说了吗
Segment #34  [00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:54,380] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 5  | Text: 婚姻讲的什么
Segment #35  [00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:55,400] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 6  | Text: 讲的没当户对
Segment #36  [00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,280] | Elapsed:  32.49s | Words: 7  | Text: 一个富家千金小姐
Segment #37  [00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:58,320] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 5  | Text: 大概率不会和一个
Segment #38  [00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,080] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 5  | Text: 亲小子结婚
Segment #39  [00:00:59,080 --> 00:01:00,220] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 4  | Text: 那同样的
Segment #40  [00:01:00,220 --> 00:01:00,920] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 4  | Text: 一个富二代
Segment #41  [00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:02,340] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 她也不可能娶一个
Segment #42  [00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:03,300] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 3  | Text: 婚姑娘
Segment #43  [00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:04,440] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 7  | Text: 这种故事只会在
Segment #44  [00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:05,000] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 3  | Text: 爽文里
Segment #45  [00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,060] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 7  | Text: 童话故事里出现
Segment #46  [00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:07,180] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 3  | Text: 你想想吧
Segment #47  [00:01:07,180 --> 00:01:07,300] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 1  | Text: 咱
Segment #48  [00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:09,000] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 9  | Text: 我举个最简单的例子
Segment #49  [00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,120] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 我们身为父母的
Segment #50  [00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:11,880] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 11 | Text: 比如说咱家里有一千个大夫女
Segment #51  [00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:13,360] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 5  | Text: 咱有个女儿
Segment #52  [00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:14,540] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 这个女儿要找个
Segment #53  [00:01:14,540 --> 00:01:15,440] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 送外卖的结婚
Segment #54  [00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:16,040] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 4  | Text: 你愿意吗
Segment #55  [00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:16,980] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 4  | Text: 你嫁不嫁
Segment #56  [00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:17,980] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 来平行老天明
Segment #57  [00:01:17,980 --> 00:01:18,620] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 5  | Text: 你没回答我
Segment #58  [00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:19,600] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 5  | Text: 如果说你的女儿
Segment #59  [00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:20,480] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 8  | Text: 找个送外卖的结婚
Segment #60  [00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:21,020] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 4  | Text: 你嫁不嫁
Segment #61  [00:01:21,020 --> 00:01:21,960] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 4  | Text: 可能我如果说
Segment #62  [00:01:21,960 --> 00:01:22,920] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 换造成当事人
Segment #63  [00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:23,820] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 4  | Text: 我就会问了
Segment #64  [00:01:23,820 --> 00:01:24,560] | Elapsed:  52.50s | Words: 3  | Text: 你拿什么
Segment #65  [00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,660] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 5  | Text: 给我女儿保证
Segment #66  [00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:26,560] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 她有个想要的生活
Segment #67  [00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:27,940] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 6  | Text: 我女儿想要用
Segment #68  [00:01:27,940 --> 00:01:29,000] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 5  | Text: 海兰之谜的时候
Segment #69  [00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:29,760] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 3  | Text: 你怎么买
Segment #70  [00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:30,640] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 4  | Text: 你拿什么买
Segment #71  [00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:31,800] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 5  | Text: 很现实的问题
Segment #72  [00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:33,040] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 4  | Text: 而且我的女儿
Segment #73  [00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:34,340] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 5  | Text: 如果说我的女儿
Segment #74  [00:01:34,340 --> 00:01:35,160] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 4  | Text: 要结婚的时候
Segment #75  [00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:36,300] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 4  | Text: 真的找了一个
Segment #76  [00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:38,060] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 8  | Text: 家庭条件不是特别好的
Segment #77  [00:01:38,060 --> 00:01:39,080] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是她对我的女儿
Segment #78  [00:01:39,080 --> 00:01:39,920] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 5  | Text: 特别特别好
Segment #79  [00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:40,600] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 2  | Text: 有可能
Segment #80  [00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:41,440] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 4  | Text: 我是说有可能
Segment #81  [00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:42,240] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 4  | Text: 我也会松火
Segment #82  [00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:43,260] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 5  | Text: 凡事没有绝对
Segment #83  [00:01:43,260 --> 00:01:44,800] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 你这个店能不能动吗
Segment #84  [00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:45,940] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 6  | Text: 我只是跟你讲建议
Segment #85  [00:01:45,940 --> 00:01:46,960] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 2  | Text: 大概率
Segment #86  [00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:47,820] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 5  | Text: 我给大家举一个
Segment #87  [00:01:47,820 --> 00:01:49,380] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 最简单的小例子
Segment #88  [00:01:49,380 --> 00:01:51,060] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 跟你们讲个小故事
Segment #89  [00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:51,800] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 5  | Text: 有一个富二代
Segment #90  [00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:53,400] | Elapsed:  71.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 把一个女人拐跑了
Segment #91  [00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,300] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是一个女孩
Segment #92  [00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:55,400] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 跟一个富二代走了
Segment #93  [00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:56,200] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 3  | Text: 然后这个时候
Segment #94  [00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,460] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 她的前男友说
Segment #95  [00:01:57,460 --> 00:01:58,820] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 这个离开我这么多年
Segment #96  [00:01:58,820 --> 00:01:59,440] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 4  | Text: 你过得怎么样
Segment #97  [00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:00,760] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 5  | Text: 你记不记得
Segment #98  [00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:02,000] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 当年你有胃病的时候
Segment #99  [00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,460] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 4  | Text: 是我每天在
Segment #100 [00:02:03,460 --> 00:02:04,760] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 精心地在照顾你
Segment #101 [00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,820] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 8  | Text: 我给你买姜切成片
Segment #102 [00:02:06,820 --> 00:02:08,040] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 我她妈我这个刀工
Segment #103 [00:02:08,040 --> 00:02:09,100] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 都赶得上出师了
Segment #104 [00:02:09,100 --> 00:02:10,320] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 你怎么抛弃了我
Segment #105 [00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:11,360] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 4  | Text: 你的这个男朋友
Segment #106 [00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,820] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 能这样照顾你吗
Segment #107 [00:02:12,820 --> 00:02:14,140] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 8  | Text: 你要是这个女孩子怎么说的
Segment #108 [00:02:14,140 --> 00:02:14,860] | Elapsed:  90.03s | Words: 4  | Text: 这个女孩子说
Segment #109 [00:02:14,860 --> 00:02:16,220] | Elapsed:  90.04s | Words: 6  | Text: 说她不会过切疆
Segment #110 [00:02:16,220 --> 00:02:17,200] | Elapsed:  90.04s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是她花了50万
Segment #111 [00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:17,920] | Elapsed:  90.04s | Words: 5  | Text: 带我上医院
Segment #112 [00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:18,880] | Elapsed:  90.04s | Words: 6  | Text: 把我的胃病治好了
Segment #113 [00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:20,600] | Elapsed:  90.04s | Words: 7  | Text: 虽然这个故事很俗
Segment #114 [00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:22,920] | Elapsed:  90.04s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是我想表达她的意思是什么
Segment #115 [00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:24,660] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 是女孩子适当的物质
Segment #116 [00:02:24,660 --> 00:02:25,580] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 是没错的
Segment #117 [00:02:25,580 --> 00:02:27,060] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 你不能总表
Segment #118 [00:02:27,060 --> 00:02:28,380] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 一是无成的温柔
Segment #119 [00:02:28,380 --> 00:02:29,920] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 老婆我好爱你
Segment #120 [00:02:30,380 --> 00:02:32,060] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 9  | Text: 我早上给你买豆浆了
Segment #121 [00:02:32,060 --> 00:02:32,820] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 2  | Text: 老婆
Segment #122 [00:02:33,380 --> 00:02:35,000] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 那个我早上给你买了
Segment #123 [00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,200] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 两个西红柿炒鸡蛋
Segment #124 [00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:37,240] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 3  | Text: 什么老婆
Segment #125 [00:02:37,660 --> 00:02:38,660] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 5  | Text: 你要反客牙宝
Segment #126 [00:02:38,660 --> 00:02:39,540] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 3  | Text: 咱不买
Segment #127 [00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:41,340] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 300块钱衣服太贵了
Segment #128 [00:02:41,340 --> 00:02:42,720] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 咱上淘宝咱买50的
Segment #129 [00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:44,760] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 9  | Text: 我再倒退一万步来讲
Segment #130 [00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:46,120] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 人也是动物
Segment #131 [00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,300] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 5  | Text: 那动物在这个
Segment #132 [00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:49,260] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 11 | Text: 选择泽武的这个交配基因里
Segment #133 [00:02:49,260 --> 00:02:49,780] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 3  | Text: 他都知道
Segment #134 [00:02:49,780 --> 00:02:51,880] | Elapsed: 108.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 我要选择一个强大的雄性
Segment #135 [00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:54,520] | Elapsed: 117.06s | Words: 5  | Text: 去作为配偶
Segment #136 [00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,220] | Elapsed: 117.06s | Words: 9  | Text: 能更好地保护好我的孩子
Segment #137 [00:02:56,220 --> 00:02:58,080] | Elapsed: 117.06s | Words: 6  | Text: 能给我去找食食
Segment #138 [00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:58,940] | Elapsed: 117.06s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #139 [00:02:58,940 --> 00:03:00,000] | Elapsed: 117.06s | Words: 5  | Text: 那你看我们如果说
Segment #140 [00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,860] | Elapsed: 117.06s | Words: 10 | Text: 作为人类这么高级的动物
Segment #141 [00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:02,880] | Elapsed: 117.06s | Words: 5  | Text: 是不是也是这个道理
